{"5045560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shuffle and Seek", "steam_appid": 5045560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever stared at a room and thought, &quot;Wait, was that chair always there?&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>​Be the Shuffler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange the room before the clock runs out! Moving big objects are risky, but they score you huge points. Sneaking a tiny cup into the corner pays less, but it might just drive the Seekers crazy. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>​Be the Seeker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out exactly what the Shufflers changed. Call &quot;Gotcha!&quot; when you are sure, or call &quot;Sus&quot; when you start doubting your own memory. You can also kick the shufflers when they are dancing in front of you to taunt you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Generative AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shuffle and Seek </i>does not use any generative AI. The models, animations, 2D images, music, and sound effects are either handcrafted directly by Groovy Zebra Studio or purchased from human-made asset stores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>​Grab your friends or play with strangers and get ready for the arguments over a misplaced lamp!</i></strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever stared at a room and thought, &quot;Wait, was that chair always there?&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>​Be the Shuffler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange the room before the clock runs out! Moving big objects are risky, but they score you huge points. Sneaking a tiny cup into the corner pays less, but it might just drive the Seekers crazy. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>​Be the Seeker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out exactly what the Shufflers changed. Call &quot;Gotcha!&quot; when you are 